<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FlameCloud Hosting - High Performance Cloud Solutions</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset and Base Styles */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Header & Navigation */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            background-color: #1e293b;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ff5722;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 25px;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            color: #ff5722;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff5722, #ff7043);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 100px 8% 80px;
            text-align: center;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 70%);
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .hero h1 span {
            color: #ff5722;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
        }

        /* Features Section */
        .features {
            padding: 80px 8%;
            background-color: #1e293b;
        }
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            margin: 15px 0 10px;
            color: #ff7043;
        }
        .feature-card p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* Pricing Section */
        .pricing {
            padding: 80px 8%;
        }
        .pricing-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .pricing-card {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        .pricing-card.featured {
            border: 2px solid #ff5722;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        .badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: -15px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background-color: #ff5722;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .price {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .price span {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
        .pricing-card ul {
            list-style: none;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
        .pricing-card ul li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: #0b1120;
            padding: 40px 8%;
            text-align: center;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo">🔥 FlameCloud</div>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
                <li><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Support</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn-primary">Get Started</a>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Ignite Your Web Presence with <span>FlameCloud</span></h1>
        <p>Ultra-fast, reliable cloud hosting optimized for speed, security, and effortless scalability.</p>
        <a href="#pricing" class="btn-primary">View Hosting Plans</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section class="features" id="features">
        <h2 class="section-title">Why Choose FlameCloud?</h2>
        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>⚡ Blazing Fast Speed</h3>
                <p>Powered by NVMe SSD storage and enterprise infrastructure for maximum loading performance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>🛡️ Enterprise Security</h3>
                <p>Free DDoS protection, automatic SSL certificates, and isolated cloud environments.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>⏱️ 99.9% Uptime Guarantee</h3>
                <p>Keep your websites live and running smoothly with uninterrupted cloud uptime.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>💬 24/7 Expert Support</h3>
                <p>Our dedicated technical support team is always available to assist with setup and troubleshooting.</p>
